-- title:
--   Original mixed Levy clipped small-mark stopped physical grid L2 integrability, centred expectation and zero clock
-- statement:
--   The true original spectrally negative Levy negative-jump marked counting increments on a physical increasing time grid, weighted by the clipped discounted pre-jump gradient and stopped at the same right-continuous stopping clock, have square-integrable finite compensated sum, precisely zero expectation and pointwise zero value at a zero clock. This holds for any jump activity, including infinite negative intensity. Uses the Proved public original stopped clipped pre-jump gradient full cutoff L2/centred theorem; no additional source decomposition.

